{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "DIYAR API — v1",
    "description": "DIYAR Marketplace REST API — Stage 2 Identity & Access.\n\n## Sanctum session auth in Postman\n\nThe backend uses **stateful Sanctum cookies**, not Bearer tokens.\n\nPostman must mimic the React SPA:\n1. Send `Origin` + `Referer` from `frontend_origin` (default `http://localhost:3000`)\n2. Keep cookies enabled (Postman Cookie Jar)\n3. Use the same `base_url` host for all requests (`localhost` vs `127.0.0.1` must not mix)\n\nMutating requests auto-refresh CSRF via `/sanctum/csrf-cookie` so tokens stay valid after login/logout.\n\nRecommended flow: CSRF Cookie → Login → Me → Logout",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "frontend_origin", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "api_version", "value": "v1" },
    { "key": "phone", "value": "500000001" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Password123!" },
    { "key": "xsrf_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const frontendOrigin = pm.collectionVariables.get('frontend_origin') || pm.environment.get('frontend_origin') || 'http://localhost:3000';",
          "const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') || pm.environment.get('base_url');",
          "const referer = frontendOrigin.replace(/\\/$/, '') + '/';",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Origin', value: frontendOrigin });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Referer', value: referer });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });",
          "",
          "function decodeXsrf(raw) {",
          "  if (!raw) {",
          "    return null;",
          "  }",
          "  try {",
          "    return decodeURIComponent(String(raw).replace(/\\+/g, ' '));",
          "  } catch (e) {",
          "    return String(raw);",
          "  }",
          "}",
          "",
          "function readXsrfFromJar(url) {",
          "  if (!url) {",
          "    return null;",
          "  }",
          "  const jar = pm.cookies.toObject(url);",
          "  if (jar && jar['XSRF-TOKEN']) {",
          "    return decodeXsrf(jar['XSRF-TOKEN']);",
          "  }",
          "  const cookie = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN', url);",
          "  if (!cookie) {",
          "    return null;",
          "  }",
          "  const raw = typeof cookie === 'string' ? cookie : cookie.value;",
          "  return decodeXsrf(raw);",
          "}",
          "",
          "function resolveXsrfToken() {",
          "  const requestUrl = pm.request.url.toString();",
          "  const candidates = [requestUrl, baseUrl, baseUrl + '/sanctum/csrf-cookie'];",
          "  for (let i = 0; i < candidates.length; i += 1) {",
          "    const token = readXsrfFromJar(candidates[i]);",
          "    if (token) {",
          "      return token;",
          "    }",
          "  }",
          "  return pm.collectionVariables.get('xsrf_token') || pm.environment.get('xsrf_token') || null;",
          "}",
          "",
          "function storeXsrfToken(token) {",
          "  if (!token) {",
          "    return;",
          "  }",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf_token', token);",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: token });",
          "}",
          "",
          "const method = pm.request.method;",
          "const requestUrl = pm.request.url.toString();",
          "const isCsrfBootstrap = requestUrl.indexOf('/sanctum/csrf-cookie') !== -1;",
          "const isMutating = ['POST', 'PUT', 'PATCH', 'DELETE'].includes(method);",
          "",
          "if (isMutating && !isCsrfBootstrap) {",
          "  await pm.sendRequest({",
          "    url: baseUrl + '/sanctum/csrf-cookie',",
          "    method: 'GET',",
          "    header: {",
          "      Origin: frontendOrigin,",
          "      Referer: referer,",
          "      Accept: 'application/json'",
          "    }",
          "  });",
          "  storeXsrfToken(resolveXsrfToken());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') || pm.environment.get('base_url');",
          "const jar = pm.cookies.toObject(baseUrl);",
          "if (jar && jar['XSRF-TOKEN']) {",
          "  try {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf_token', decodeURIComponent(String(jar['XSRF-TOKEN']).replace(/\\+/g, ' ')));",
          "  } catch (e) {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('xsrf_token', String(jar['XSRF-TOKEN']));",
          "  }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Run in order for session auth:\n1. CSRF Cookie\n2. Login (or Register → Verify OTP)\n3. Me\n4. Logout\n\nPOST requests auto-refresh CSRF before sending.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. CSRF Cookie",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('CSRF cookie request succeeds', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('XSRF-TOKEN cookie is stored', function () {",
                  "  const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') || pm.environment.get('base_url');",
                  "  const jar = pm.cookies.toObject(baseUrl);",
                  "  pm.expect(jar['XSRF-TOKEN'], 'Cookie jar must store XSRF-TOKEN for ' + baseUrl).to.exist;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login succeeds', function () {",
                  "  if (pm.response.code === 419) {",
                  "    pm.expect.fail('CSRF token mismatch — clear cookies, run \"1. CSRF Cookie\", then retry Login');",
                  "  }",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Session cookie is stored', function () {",
                  "  const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') || pm.environment.get('base_url');",
                  "  const jar = pm.cookies.toObject(baseUrl);",
                  "  const hasSession = Object.keys(jar).some(function (name) {",
                  "    return name.toLowerCase().includes('session');",
                  "  });",
                  "  pm.expect(hasSession, 'diyar-session cookie should be set after login').to.be.true;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"phone\",\n  \"identifier\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Me",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Authenticated user is returned', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.phone).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Logout succeeds', function () {",
                  "  if (pm.response.code === 419) {",
                  "    pm.expect.fail('CSRF token mismatch — run Login + Me first, or re-import the latest collection');",
                  "  }",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/logout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test User\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"roles\": [\"customer\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"000000\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/verify-otp"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/resend-otp"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/forgot-password"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"000000\",\n  \"password\": \"NewPassword123!\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"NewPassword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/{{api_version}}/auth/reset-password"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
